{"title":"Ancient Bog","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 40 Bog that attacks with crush (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"tag-chip weak\">burn</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">slash</span> &nbsp; <i>Resists</i> <span class=\"tag-chip resist\">corrode</span><span class=\"tag-chip resist\">crush</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 30% damage and a resistance takes 30% off (the game's own rule).</p>\n      \n      <p class=\"s\">Special: mireChance: .35 | mireSlowMs: 2500</p>\n      \n      \n      <h2>Appearance</h2><p class=\"s muted\">How the game draws it. Archers and mages wear better armor as their level goes up.</p><div class=\"look-grid\"><div class=\"look-card on\"><img src=\"data/img/605c27b7babed7141f82.webp\" alt=\"\"><div><b>Mage (Acid)</b><div class=\"g-note\">Level 25–44 · Ogrewax armor</div></div></div><div class=\"look-card on\"><img src=\"data/img/e957ab25c650d773e64c.webp\" alt=\"\"><div><b>Mage (Fire)</b><div class=\"g-note\">Level 25–44 · Ogrewax armor</div></div></div></div>\n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div class=\"muted\">No kills of this monster reported yet; 8 looted corpses recorded.</div><div style=\"margin-top:8px\"><b>Normal loot</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"gold-coin\" title=\"Gold Coin - in 0% of 8 looted corpses, 31 recorded drops, 1,230 total, 15–61 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/2216cc0344c9d30bb3ee.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Gold Coin</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">0% · 0/8</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"peat-clod\" title=\"Peat Clod - in 75% of 8 looted corpses, 6 recorded drops, 10 total, 1–2 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/f756d6ee3fa57e31c8db.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Peat Clod</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">75% · 6/8</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"bog-pelt\" title=\"Bog Pelt - in 75% of 8 looted corpses, 6 recorded drops, 10 total, 1–2 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/851eda3e442f3ed8925d.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Bog Pelt</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">75% · 6/8</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"mire-essence\" title=\"Mire Essence - in 50% of 8 looted corpses, 4 recorded drops, 6 total, 1–2 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/284aeada05ba452c76f1.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Mire Essence</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">50% · 4/8</span></div></div></div><div class=\"muted\" style=\"margin-top:8px\">Percentages are of the corpses whose loot the collector recorded, so kills you did not loot are not counted.</div></div>\n      \n      <h2>Where to find it</h2><p class=\"muted\">No sightings yet.</p>\n      \n      <h2>Related</h2><p>Other Bog: <a href=\"#/monster/bogling\">Bogling</a> <span class=\"muted\">(25)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/bog\">Bog</a> <span class=\"muted\">(30)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/elder-bog\">Elder Bog</a> <span class=\"muted\">(35)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/mire-bog\">Mire Bog</a> <span class=\"muted\">(37)</span></p>\n      <p class=\"wp-guides\"><b>Guides:</b> <a href=\"#/guide/combat\">Combat</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monster-families\">Monster families</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monsters-by-level\">Monsters by level</a></p>\n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic\"><img src=\"data/img/605c27b7babed7141f82.webp\" alt=\"Ancient Bog\"></div><h3>Ancient Bog</h3><table>\n      <tr><th>Level</th><td><b>40</b> <span class=\"muted\">(picked · base 40)</span></td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Family</th><td>Bog</td></tr><tr><th>Attacks</th><td>crush · melee</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Hitpoints</th><td>194</td></tr><tr><th>Damage</th><td>26.5</td></tr><tr><th>XP</th><td>2,000</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Attack speed</th><td>3.6 s</td></tr><tr><th>Attack range</th><td>1.6</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Aggressive</th><td>Yes (7 tiles)</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Drops gems</th><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><th>Pendant / cape</th><td>Can drop</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Seen</th><td>8 times</td></tr>\n    </table></aside></article>"}